# Google Sheet ids backing the log pages. Copy this file to `.env` and fill in.
#
# The VITE_ prefix is required — Vite only exposes prefixed variables to client
# code. These end up in the built bundle and are readable by anyone, which is
# fine: the sheets have to be world-readable for the fetch to work at all. Do
# not put anything private in them.
#
# Each sheet's first row must be the header:
#   name | date | thoughts | image1 | image2 | image3 | maps
#
# A log with no id set, or an empty sheet, renders the section's empty state.

VITE_COFFEE_LOG=""
VITE_RUNNING_LOG=""
